=== Embedding 模型核验 ===
来源: https://huggingface.co/Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (经 hf-mirror.com 镜像下载)
基础模型: sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2
许可证: apache-2.0
维度: 384 (config.json hidden_size)
model_type: bert, max_position_embeddings: 512
Repo SHA: 751bff37182d3f1213fa05d7196b954e230abad9
量化: ONNX INT8 (QuantizedFp? default dynamic quantization, model_quantized.onnx)

=== 真实文件体积 ===
config.json                 650 B
tokenizer.json              711,661 B
tokenizer_config.json       366 B
special_tokens_map.json     125 B
onnx/model.onnx (FP32)      90,387,606 B  (86.2 MiB)
onnx/model_quantized.onnx   22,972,370 B  (21.9 MiB, INT8)

压缩比 = 90,387,606 / 22,972,370 = 3.935x
体积减少 = 74.6%

=== npm 安装 ===
npm install seekdb@1.4.0 -> 失败 EUNSUPPORTEDPROTOCOL workspace:*
npm install seekdb@1.4.0 --legacy-peer-deps -> 成功 (added 13 packages)
原生库: @seekdb/js-bindings@1.4.0 下载 win32-x64 二进制 ~331MB 到 ~/.seekdb/bindings
